    title: "Championship Soccer",
    description: Some("Four-a-side soccer — a forward, two defenders and a goalkeeper per team — steered by joystick, with 54 variations spanning single-player and head-to-head play at different speeds, match lengths and goal widths. Endorsed by Pelé late in development, it was reissued under picture labels as Pelé\'s Soccer, while Sears\' Tele-Games line sold it plainly as Soccer."),
